4. Merge Sort

Algorithm: 

MergeSort(arr, left, right)
Step 1: Start
Step 2: If left < right:
2.1: mid = left + (right - left) / 2
2.2: MergeSort(arr, left, mid)
2.3: MergeSort(arr, mid + 1, right)
2.4: Merge(arr, left, mid, right)
Step 3: Exit / Stop

Time Complexities:

Best Case: O(n \log n)
Average Case: O(n \log n)
Worst Case: O(n \log n)
